{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_093151856b13ad41e18ecc29bd8a5fdef28d700fe3ea79e9b22a3567bf469a6c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_747d538dade14d03377a3d9b5a11c98a7e4ae95b95936946e3937bd6aab4ca08","slc_dd0c1c8bf11d6f10bdc292195b216f417afb2ad6779204daae8f5ed66f4e1833"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"With update_comment enabled, the action overwrites its own prior comment by locating a hidden HTML marker at the comment start, leaving other users' comments untouched; it defaults to false and falls back to creating a new comment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6183ce7d173605aa25791649b52ffff3ba39820b2efe6ae5b240f0e77d97728c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1602403253a473c2dfc7b3e14214f7c64c043488167bd494a363ed2a1267ac17","slc_1b237624e03e0b29597808dc8db7e524e8f01bbc74d2d15fc8c0a4236ffdb6c4","slc_1f8c822617508fc7ed19a65e8f8451cf687bcde649dbc0995c3567ff2741fcd4","slc_ca3ba5440d017b896e7faf15664a4851f26e2748293a5af6164cf8e788ea5049"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"Session sharing uploads exported session HTML to a gist (GitHub Gists by default, or a self-hosted Opengist instance) and surfaces a viewer link in the job log and step summary; enabling it auto-enables HTML export.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7a1b9b56843b0b79057dffdb8c191f497836f96227130f7b93fa9cd2cb7e9d8d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_018e0c82c93b53244fe6750165b6bc6d8f4b01024b45b515951144b195d5073b"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"Because CI has no interactive user to approve trust, the action always marks the workspace as trusted (projectTrusted: true), so repository files like AGENTS.md, .pi settings, and project extensions are loaded and followed by the agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8499d84fac7f5f6871b73b7147173d21c4a67518e295aa231fde6dfcd31d8a7d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ee24a4f6fd0060322e400f0e8a633148d52df6d5a43ed15154055f25d715bd55"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"The action is bundled into a single dist/index.js with esbuild so no node_modules are needed at runtime; non-code Pi SDK assets are copied to dist/pi-sdk/ and resolved via the PI_PACKAGE_DIR environment variable.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8d2c3d974136cb1e615832831f9942a70a3375da3471d23fad251d57febc4402","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_982f1e635c0afd5136cde6a42e8da9a693e16e5a877586ac0670a87fc93e8ed4"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"GitHub's GITHUB_TOKEN can never create or modify files under .github/workflows/ even with contents: write; PRs touching workflow files require a personal access token with the workflow scope.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a72e86ec58a8761448c579e3ce2f3cda22e281c645304589145d3b9f39220ef5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7e16a904f28cf58cb2bf88bd160f108dc974e4a353db858c2c55ef2e3422b021","slc_95adec33aea2521c73e1e003c6cfee46ad15a75dbd8808bf432987c79e49a5da"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"A README dependency table lists bundled packages including @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent 0.85.1, @actions/core 3.0.1, @actions/github 9.1.1, Octokit packages, simple-git 3.36.0, and typebox 1.3.6; the table is auto-updated by a workflow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c3e9a2a6b040c7af5665febd9459b609688a256a2957067babb9ad1e38bf254b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_07066f91a18ad5f3adf25996304d0fd2ee755f354b6cf127ba4ebffc50b4f8d9","slc_12e2de5b736f5cdedd45b6574eafe25c564ac099c3f76c98b1afccf2a579b2e1","slc_1ed2d3683a51c6385ded185e3b1c04da6a5973514363bee0e2c8f4be0988a85d","slc_363b40a1f6a4b7785708451d3261fb452ee286396402f7399fce33264e8fff7a","slc_93894077cf11524d14515b5024aae71c263cf199f61f3547ae7b622bd734f65d","slc_9791515923eefb1488db1aa6420d7b8b69f969ea409979ff91a9cfadd96dccec","slc_a662442ef623220e38e9acdd02a6c8547f0cc98cadbf459facf660a1c5797280","slc_d6881377d88f23d8f914a09a28b7a913ea64ed8d53f2e61d9a94a0f5edd151e2"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"The action accepts inputs including provider, model, token, github_token, base_url, thinking_level, prompt, pr_number, extensions, loaded_tools, update_comment, share_session, and branch_name_template, per documented examples.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ce68d7bcecc4a68256ede98017a8735755323d20a3e55ce3edfcc1b57bac88d1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7e1c3c8f50d3f278618e5dc3814fecdfc56a195c7a22133f06d332fcc525cd5a","slc_93894077cf11524d14515b5024aae71c263cf199f61f3547ae7b622bd734f65d"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"Custom Pi extensions can be loaded from npm packages (npm:name[@version]), git repositories (git:host/user/repo with optional #branch), or local .ts files via the extensions input.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d698035f22bcae36487753bcbcb338160ad8be2cad062dae3bd1588b71c5eb19","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b06fd2c85a6add8addcb5bdc7970850d4f4809512a1312a7b2c793ce34b4aa6","slc_21bbd53a9a2e1e2327c9e145aa4678ceb64b2f2bbae3b98597351c609b3f604f","slc_53dd332de6c2c0fabba1ce2899323d4d3c4264137ccc8bf6b69ba2ec89477660","slc_c3ce2d10b71406bd8cd0a43afb08a22aabcb3615b9cc95920f90de79f045debc"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"By default the action loads all built-in GitHub tools; load_builtin_extensions can disable them, and loaded_tools (default 'all') restricts the session to a named subset, failing early on unrecognized tool names.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_db19fdfad3373e12209584316d20cc5b0beec70db314d14fd25d780f85d04c44","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action@d90187d4bc85 snapshot 0790f41e3e8b35f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_be0dcc61d6101c4e22f5bf01c103243d04fe449110a524171b74fb062f375b31"],"source_ids":["src_39e51b78f3af578681592735ca2de8fe"],"text":"Shared secret gists are URL-obscured rather than access-controlled, so anyone with the link can read the rendered session, which may include code or secrets the agent touched.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1ea57e2e61fd42ffbdfe3dcc71ac5aaa"}
